WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:05.930
Because that's the truth
of the words "come forth,"

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.260
which the Tribe of Gold once said to us.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:14.810
Stars aren't born only from the various
powers that flow in the universe.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:19.770
The interaction of lives from different
planets can also create starways.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.070
Filling this universe with starways...

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.280
I have already seen it...

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.870
That's why we met Age.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:37.750
Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:43.920
Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:04.320
Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:11.410
Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:13.330
(Kurai)

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:18.370
Yami ni sumishi mamono

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.210
(Blight)

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:23.840
Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.340
(Eiyuu wo motomu)

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:28.010
Mezame arugamama

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:36.850
Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:41.860
Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:50.700
Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:54.830
Fureau ga sadame

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:26.360
I shall now entrust the
one who guides the planets

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:30.860
beyond the starways with the memories
that I have been governing.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:43.540
The name of the planet
which only you can find is...

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.750
...Elysium.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.140
Princess!

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.010
I'm all right.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.810
The memories are presented
in a different way, that's all.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:06.110
Return your consciousness to a blank
and just keep opening your heart.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:46.860
Mehitak!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.730
It's foolish to listen in any longer.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:55.990
The belief that the power of the
Tribe of Gold is still hidden somewhere

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.450
is itself just an illusion.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:59.990
But there's no basis for
you to make that assumption.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:06.250
The Tribe of Gold abandoned this universe,
and us, without a reason or an explanation.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.460
But the past and the fact
that you refuse to accept

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.630
the existence of the
power have no connection.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:16.390
I agree with Rom Ror.
The Tribe of Gold betrayed us.

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.800
But their true intention is unclear.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.520
It's not a reason to stop their dialogue.
Let's see what happens.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:23.480
I agree.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.430
Let's see.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.480
I agree.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.080
No need to worry.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:45.290
My fellow beings also have hopes for this.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:49.750
They look to our dialogue to establish order.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.140
Can you feel it?

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:09.350
The place in the universe where the
Tribe of Gold emerged a long, long time ago.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:13.280
The memory of the Elysium,
which is called the "coffin of wisdom."

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:24.240
I can feel the strong will has been passed
down from far, far away in a distant time.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:31.210
It looks as though the choice was not mistaken.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:35.510
The memories and the emotions
that I have been governing

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:40.510
may have been there just so
that I could entrust them to you.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:51.980
It appears that the majority of our
fellow beings now agree with me.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:53.940
So that means...

00:05:54.030 --> 00:06:01.110
Most of your fellow beings
will escape destruction for now.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:11.500
However, that reprieve is
only to review the possibility

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:16.630
for you to discover the
power of the Tribe of Gold.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:25.010
There are still a few who refuse to
accept the possibility our dialogue has led to.

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:32.100
Rom Ror will chase you as you head to Elysium,

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:35.610
along with the Nodos that he rules.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:40.200
And if you fail to find the path,

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:46.240
or if the power of the Tribe of Gold
doesn't exist even after you've found the path,

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:53.960
most of my fellow beings will once again
favor the annihilation of the Tribe of Iron.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.380
I understand.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:07:04.140
But I strongly believe that the
power of the Tribe of Gold does exist.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:09.350
I still can't make a strong statement like that.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:15.230
The existence of their power is only
suggested in the agreements of the Nodos.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:19.070
Aren't the agreements of the Nodos
indicating the path to all of us,

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:25.410
every living being in this universe?

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:28.990
That is what I'm thinking.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.500
The path? The future?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:42.800
I, too, was thinking that what the
agreements indicate might be the future.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:46.970
Yes. The future we will never
be able to attain if we give up

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.680
without doing anything about it...

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:54.350
The best future we should reach...

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.400
That's what I believe.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.660
I'm glad that I met you.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:13.910
Me, too... Something became
very clear to me by meeting you.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.580
The power to show the path...

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:21.590
The power to create
a starway lies within anyone.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.170
Anyone?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:27.640
You have taken on the
memories of the tribe by yourself

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:33.230
and shown your tribe the path
with your posture and actions.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:38.360
I will continue to show the path
to the ones that I live with, too.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:46.530
By doing so, I suspect everyone will eventually
awaken to the same power that I have.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:49.490
And if that happens...

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:54.660
Lives will be connected, and interact
with each other between the planets.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:58.710
And that will become the
power to create starways...

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.460
And this universe will be filled with starways.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:07.260
That is what the Tribe of Gold wanted.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:11.350
That was what they were
trying to do in this universe.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.280
There's no way

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:28.200
the lowly Tribe of Iron understands
what the Tribe of Gold was thinking!

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:33.830
The mentality and action called praying
has sunk deep into distant memories,

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.750
and nothing exists to be prayed to, either.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:42.670
However, if I were to express
what I'm thinking right now,

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:45.880
"praying" would be an appropriate word.

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:52.430
I pray that you will guide
your fellow beings to Elysium,

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:57.100
and discover the power of the Tribe of Gold.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.520
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.480
I thank you for the wisdom and the
bold decision that you've shown me...

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:08.400
And the fact that you believed
in the possibility for order.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.210
Dhianeila-sama!
 Dhianeila-sama!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:22.210
Dhianeila-sama, you're okay!

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.340
Thanks to Iolaous.

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.260
Iolaous?

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:38.180
The princess is exhausted.
I'd like to ask the gentleman to leave.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:40.140
Excuse me!

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.360
Iolaous.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.820
Thank you.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.860
I'll meditate now.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.820
Dhianeila-sama, you should get some rest.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:57.870
There's no time to rest.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:02.170
I must find the path as soon as possible.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:06.540
I believe this will be the
last chance for us to put an end

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:09.090
to the war against the Tribe of Silver.

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:16.260
Sooner or later the princess will show us
the direction to the planet called Elysium.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:25.860
This is a journey where we don't even
know how long it'll take us to get there.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:28.230
I understand that this will
make you carry extra burden

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:30.780
while you're busily occupied
with the fleet reorganization,

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:35.240
but meanwhile please
take care of the fleet, Nilval.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:38.200
The conversation between the princess
and the Tribe of Silver got recorded, right?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.250
Of course, Master.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.580
Send the record to all the fleets.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:45.380
And send that to Nilval as well
with the message I just recorded.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.710
Understood.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:52.260
Elysium, an ancient planet
that has lost its starway...

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:56.720
And the power of the Tribe of Gold...

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.270
Please show us a way, princess...

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:03.270
to the future which awaits
at the end of this journey...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:10.360
Does this mean that the
dialogue reached a conclusion?

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:16.700
Is the Tribe of Iron really trying to find
the way to the planet where everything began?

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:23.710
Prome-sama, you believe in the possibility
and are now about to discover it.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:27.500
Then, may I too believe
that something I can call

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:32.300
a possibility exists
even at the end of this war?

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:54.690
Age... I feel it.

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:59.950
You're suffering in battle once again.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.330
Just like you told me to,

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:06.210
I'll only focus on moving forward for now...

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.920
with the faith that you will come for sure.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.300
The princess just indicated our first course.

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:26.180
After several warps, we will leave the
starway under the princess' direction.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:31.440
Our final destination is the planet Elysium.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:35.530
Let's go. While our Mr. Hero is fighting for us,

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:39.200
we'll do whatever it takes to get to
the place that the princess showed us!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.240
Warp in!

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.100
Fortunately, Artemia
managed to escape the madness

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:13.310
thanks to the exhaustion of its own power.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:18.570
But at this rate, either Kervius
or Belcross will be forced to...

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.530
Time is running out.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.660
I'll settle this as soon as possible.

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:24.200
Lernaea...

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.140
Karkinos!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.940
She's not stopping?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.150
Yuty...

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:13.750
Yuty?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.420
Hasn't she realized the presence of Karkinos?

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.990
Madness!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.870
At this rate, Kervius will go down first.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.250
We're going to jump, Erymanthos!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.700
One more time!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.470
Mehitak!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.380
Mehitak.

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:15.390
Karkinos.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:34.340
Yuty...

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:46.150
Stop! Yuty!

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.660
Jump! Erymanthos!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.020
Age?

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:31.170
No one is here...

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:41.850
They are gone...

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:48.560
Karkinos...

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:33.230
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:40.610
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:46.240
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:56.920
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:09.520
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:20.860
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:26.200
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:32.710
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.460
Yuty continues to suffer.
And she directs her hatred toward...

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:44.800
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 23: "The Four."
